Infuse your body with lightning energy, bolstering your movement speed by [+5%, +7%, +10%, +12%, +15% (TL1-5)].

Each turn, a foe within range [2, 4, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] will be struck by lightning and be dealt [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Lightning damage.

In addition, damage to your health will energize you.

At the start of each turn in which you have lost at least 200 life (20% of your maximum life) since your last turn, you will gain [81%, 92%, 100%, 107%, 114% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of a turn.

The effects increase with your Spellpower.
